  rows plus statements M2 and M5; E18 with its time-boxed sign-off; the one-page E8/E7/E11 sheet; the E12 page.
  Added 2026-10-12: the anchored-versus-unanchored-signature negative control; `ISSUANCE_WINDOW` and
